## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates ability to design scalable, secure multi-tenant streaming data pipelines with strict isolation and governance.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation with per-tenant resources and naming
- Pub/Sub ingestion design and fan-out strategy
- Dataflow streaming with keyed aggregation
- Per-tenant BigQuery datasets and residency controls (IAM, VPC Service Controls)
- Idempotent processing, dead-letter queues, observability, and rollback

